    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start": 376.78000000000003,
      "end": 377.24
    },
    {
      "text": " So you didn't do anything?",
      "start": 382.62,
      "end": 383.98
    },
    {
      "text": " You let me do this to myself?",
      "start": 386.26000000000005,
      "end": 387.98
    },
    {
      "text": " All week long, I could have had soda.",
