      "end": 418.56
    },
    {
      "text": " That's right, beautiful mind.",
      "start": 424.02000000000004,
      "end": 425.7
    },
    {
      "text": " Because it takes a beautiful mind",
      "start": 427.46000000000004,
      "end": 429.44
